# This repo is not Prettier-formatted. Its TypeScript is hand-formatted and no
# printWidth setting reproduces it — roughly half of the existing source files
# disagree with Prettier at every width tried (90/100/110/120/140).
#
# A global editor/agent hook that runs `prettier --write` on save therefore
# rewrites entire files on any touch, burying real changes in reformat noise.
# Ignoring everything makes that hook inert here without anyone having to change
# their personal tooling.
#
# If the repo ever adopts Prettier, do it as one deliberate formatting commit and
# delete this file.
*
